"content": "<style>\nh1.thlex-title { font-size: 1.3em; margin: 0 0 0.4em; }\n.thlex-key { color: #888; font-size: 0.85em; font-weight: normal; margin-right: 0.4em; }\nnav.thlex-index { margin: 0.5em 0 0.75em; }\nnav.thlex-index ul { margin: 0; padding-left: 1.2em; }\nnav.thlex-index li { margin: 0.15em 0; font-size: 0.95em; }\n.thlex-section { margin: 0.6em 0; }\nh2.thlex-heading { font-size: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0 0.2em; }\nh3.thlex-subheading { font-size: 0.95em; font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; margin: 0.2em 0; }\n.thlex-language-sets { margin: 0.3em 0 0.3em 1em; }\n.thlex-language-set { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 0.75em; border-left: 3px solid #e0e0e0; }\n.thlex-language { font-size: 0.8em; color: #888; margin-right: 0.4em; }\n.thlex-lemma { font-weight: bold; font-family: serif; }\n.thlex-translit { color: #555; font-style: italic; font-size: 0.9em; margin-left: 0.3em; }\n.thlex-refs { font-size: 0.85em; color: #444; margin-top: 0.15em; }\n.thlex-paragraphs p { margin: 0.35em 0; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.5; }\n.thlex-image { margin: 0.5em 0; display: block; }\n.thlex-image img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }\nfigcaption.thlex-caption { font-size: 0.85em; color: #555; font-style: italic; margin-top: 0.2em; }\n.thlex-abbr { border-bottom: 1px dotted #888; cursor: help; }\n.thlex-xref { color: #1a5fb4; }\ntable.thlex-table { border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0.5em 0; }\ntable.thlex-table td { padding: 0.2em 0.6em; vertical-align: top; border: 1px solid #ddd; }\ntable.thlex-table tr:first-child td { font-weight: bold; background: #f5f5f5; }\nul.thlex-index-list { margin: 0.4em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; font-size: 0.95em; line-height: 1.6; }\nul.thlex-index-list ul { margin: 0.1em 0; padding-left: 1.4em; }\n.thlex-index-key { font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; }\n</style><h1 class=\"thlex-title\" id=\"FAUNA:1.3\"><span class=\"thlex-key\">1.3</span> 标题：野生动物或危险动物</h1><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">经文出处</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-sets\">\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：בְּהֵמָה</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：behemah)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05028026\" data-end-ref=\"05028026\">DEU 28:26</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05032024\" data-end-ref=\"05032024\">DEU 32:24</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"09017044\" data-end-ref=\"09017044\">1SA 17:44</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24007033\" data-end-ref=\"24007033\">JER 7:33</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24015003\" data-end-ref=\"24015003\">JER 15:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24016004\" data-end-ref=\"24016004\">JER 16:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24021006\" data-end-ref=\"24021006\">JER 21:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24034020\" data-end-ref=\"24034020\">JER 34:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29001020\" data-end-ref=\"29001020\">JOL 1:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"29002022\" data-end-ref=\"29002022\">JOL 2:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"33005007\" data-end-ref=\"33005007\">MIC 5:7</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Hebrew</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">来：חַיָּה, חֵיוָה</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：chayah, cheva)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01002020\" data-end-ref=\"01002020\">GEN 2:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01003001\" data-end-ref=\"01003001\">GEN 3:1</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01003014\" data-end-ref=\"01003014\">GEN 3:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01037020\" data-end-ref=\"01037020\">GEN 37:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"01037033\" data-end-ref=\"01037033\">GEN 37:33</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02023011\" data-end-ref=\"02023011\">EXO 23:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"02023029\" data-end-ref=\"02023029\">EXO 23:29</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03017013\" data-end-ref=\"03017013\">LEV 17:13</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03026006\" data-end-ref=\"03026006\">LEV 26:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"03026022\" data-end-ref=\"03026022\">LEV 26:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"05007022\" data-end-ref=\"05007022\">DEU 7:22</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"10021010\" data-end-ref=\"10021010\">2SA 21:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"12014009\" data-end-ref=\"12014009\">2KI 14:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"14025018\" data-end-ref=\"14025018\">2CH 25:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18005023\" data-end-ref=\"18005023\">JOB 5:23</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18039015\" data-end-ref=\"18039015\">JOB 39:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"18040020\" data-end-ref=\"18040020\">JOB 40:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"23043020\" data-end-ref=\"23043020\">ISA 43:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24012009\" data-end-ref=\"24012009\">JER 12:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24027006\" data-end-ref=\"24027006\">JER 27:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"24028014\" data-end-ref=\"24028014\">JER 28:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26031006\" data-end-ref=\"26031006\">EZK 31:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26031013\" data-end-ref=\"26031013\">EZK 31:13</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26034005\" data-end-ref=\"26034005\">EZK 34:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26034008\" data-end-ref=\"26034008\">EZK 34:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26038020\" data-end-ref=\"26038020\">EZK 38:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26039004\" data-end-ref=\"26039004\">EZK 39:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"26039017\" data-end-ref=\"26039017\">EZK 39:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"28002014\" data-end-ref=\"28002014\">HOS 2:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"28002020\" data-end-ref=\"28002020\">HOS 2:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"28004003\" data-end-ref=\"28004003\">HOS 4:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"28013008\" data-end-ref=\"28013008\">HOS 13:8</data></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"thlex-language-set\">\n<span class=\"thlex-language\">Greek</span> <span class=\"thlex-lemma\">希：θηρίον</span> <span class=\"thlex-translit\">(音译：thērion)</span>\n<div class=\"thlex-refs\"><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41001013\" data-end-ref=\"41001013\">MRK 1:13</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44011006\" data-end-ref=\"44011006\">ACT 11:6</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44028004\" data-end-ref=\"44028004\">ACT 28:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44028005\" data-end-ref=\"44028005\">ACT 28:5</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"56001012\" data-end-ref=\"56001012\">TIT 1:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58012020\" data-end-ref=\"58012020\">HEB 12:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"59003007\" data-end-ref=\"59003007\">JAS 3:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66006008\" data-end-ref=\"66006008\">REV 6:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66011007\" data-end-ref=\"66011007\">REV 11:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013001\" data-end-ref=\"66013001\">REV 13:1</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013002\" data-end-ref=\"66013002\">REV 13:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013003\" data-end-ref=\"66013003\">REV 13:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013004\" data-end-ref=\"66013004\">REV 13:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013004\" data-end-ref=\"66013004\">REV 13:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013004\" data-end-ref=\"66013004\">REV 13:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013011\" data-end-ref=\"66013011\">REV 13:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013012\" data-end-ref=\"66013012\">REV 13:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013012\" data-end-ref=\"66013012\">REV 13:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013014\" data-end-ref=\"66013014\">REV 13:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013014\" data-end-ref=\"66013014\">REV 13:14</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013015\" data-end-ref=\"66013015\">REV 13:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013015\" data-end-ref=\"66013015\">REV 13:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013015\" data-end-ref=\"66013015\">REV 13:15</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013017\" data-end-ref=\"66013017\">REV 13:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013018\" data-end-ref=\"66013018\">REV 13:18</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66014009\" data-end-ref=\"66014009\">REV 14:9</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66014011\" data-end-ref=\"66014011\">REV 14:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66015002\" data-end-ref=\"66015002\">REV 15:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66016002\" data-end-ref=\"66016002\">REV 16:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66016010\" data-end-ref=\"66016010\">REV 16:10</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66016013\" data-end-ref=\"66016013\">REV 16:13</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66017003\" data-end-ref=\"66017003\">REV 17:3</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66017007\" data-end-ref=\"66017007\">REV 17:7</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66017008\" data-end-ref=\"66017008\">REV 17:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66017008\" data-end-ref=\"66017008\">REV 17:8</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66017011\" data-end-ref=\"66017011\">REV 17:11</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66017012\" data-end-ref=\"66017012\">REV 17:12</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66017013\" data-end-ref=\"66017013\">REV 17:13</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66017016\" data-end-ref=\"66017016\">REV 17:16</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66017017\" data-end-ref=\"66017017\">REV 17:17</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66018002\" data-end-ref=\"66018002\">REV 18:2</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66019019\" data-end-ref=\"66019019\">REV 19:19</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66019020\" data-end-ref=\"66019020\">REV 19:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66019020\" data-end-ref=\"66019020\">REV 19:20</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66020004\" data-end-ref=\"66020004\">REV 20:4</data>, <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66020010\" data-end-ref=\"66020010\">REV 20:10</data></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">描述</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>这些是野生的或者对人类有危险的动物，可能是狮子和狼等动物，也可能指蛇。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">特殊意义或象征意义</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>《启示录》中的&quot;兽&quot;与极端邪恶有联系。</p>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"thlex-section\">\n<h2 class=\"thlex-heading\">翻译</h2>\n<div class=\"thlex-paragraphs\">\n<p>一般来说，翻译者可以通过经文中的修饰语，如&quot;邪恶的&quot;、&quot;野的&quot;、&quot;野地的&quot;、&quot;地上的&quot;、&quot;林中的&quot;等，来确定<em>behemah</em> 、<em>chayah</em> 和<em>cheva</em> 是不是指野生动物或危险的动物。</p>\n<p>在《次经•马加比传》（《思》《玛加伯传》），<em>thērion</em> 通常指大象，这个词的字面意思是&quot;大型动物&quot;。参<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"UBSFaunaLexicon\" data-key=\"FAUNA:2.14\" href=\"#FAUNA:2.14\">2.14 象 (elephant)</a> 。</p>\n<p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44028004\" data-end-ref=\"44028004\">ACT 28:4</data>; <data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"44028005\" data-end-ref=\"44028005\">ACT 28:5</data> ：前面的第3节说，保罗被一条毒蛇咬伤（参<a class=\"thlex-xref\" data-bnType=\"lexiconLink\" data-collection=\"UBSFaunaLexicon\" data-key=\"FAUNA:4.10\" href=\"#FAUNA:4.10\">4.10 蝰蛇 (viper)</a> ），但在希腊文译本的第4节和第5节，这条毒蛇被称为<em>to thērion</em> （&quot;危险的动物&quot;）。大多数英文译本都将这个词译为&quot;the snake&quot;（&quot;蛇&quot;）；大多数语言常将&quot;毒蛇&quot;仅仅称为&quot;蛇&quot;。有些译本采用&quot;有毒的东西&quot;之类的短语。</p>\n<p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"58012020\" data-end-ref=\"58012020\">HEB 12:20</data> ：在这节经文中，<em>thērion</em> 似乎不是特指危险的动物，而是泛指动物。许多现代英文译本将这里的<em>thērion</em> 译作&quot;an animal&quot;（&quot;一个动物&quot;）。</p>\n<p>在所有其他经文中，<em>thērion</em> 都被译成&quot;野生动物&quot;或&quot;危险的动物&quot;。在《启示录》中，这个词所指的动物事实上是一种象征，所以有时被译为当地文化中代表邪恶的特定动物（例如土狼）。然而，翻译者只有在不得已的时候才应作此选择，因为《启示录》的作者使用的是统称，而不是一个具体的名称，从而让读者自己去想象他指的是什么样的危险动物。对于《启示录》4—6章中代表良善的&quot;活物&quot;，与后续章节中代表邪恶的&quot;野兽&quot;，翻译者应注意清楚区分。</p>\n<p>以下材料改写自UBS的《&lt;启示录&gt;手册》对于<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66011007\" data-end-ref=\"66011007\">REV 11:7</data> 和<data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"66013001\" data-end-ref=\"66013001\">REV 13:1</data> 的说明：</p>\n<p>译为&quot;兽&quot;的词在原文中仅仅意指&quot;动物&quot;，<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"American Translation (Goodspeed, 1935)\">AT</abbr> 和<abbr class=\"thlex-abbr\" title=\"J.B. Phillips: The New Testament in Modern English (1958)\">Phps</abbr> 将其译成&quot;the animal&quot;（&quot;那个动物&quot;），这种译法在英文中显得有些奇怪。翻译者必须尽可能找到一个特别的词来翻译这些生物。也许可以使用传说或童话中的词语，因为传说或童话里面经常出现奇异的动物。在这里，&quot;怪物&quot;或&quot;野兽&quot;，甚至&quot;食人魔&quot;之类的词语，都是合适的。有些语言只有驯养动物和野生动物这两类，此时有必要使用&quot;可怕的野兽&quot;、&quot;巨大的、可怕的动物&quot;，甚至&quot;吓人的、凶猛的动物&quot;这样的短语来对&quot;兽&quot;进行限定。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
